## ⚡ Quick Reference

```bash
poetry run pytest          # Backend tests
pnpm test                  # Frontend tests
pnpm typecheck             # TypeScript strict verification
poetry run ruff check .    # Python lint
```

## 🛡️ Key Constraints

- **Type hints required** (Python + TypeScript strict)
- **No hardcoded colors** — use `var(--color-*)`
- **Privacy-first** — Presidio sanitization for PII
- **Docs = Code** — update docs when changing logic

## 🔒 TypeScript Strict Mode (CRITICAL)

```typescript
// Array access - ALWAYS use fallback
const item = array[0] ?? defaultValue;

// Optional props - ALWAYS include | undefined
interface Props { onClick?: (() => void) | undefined; }

// Never setState in useEffect directly
// Use useRef, lazy init, or useSyncExternalStore
```

Be concise, precise, and secure.
